TravelShipB Arrives Ironspine
    Events
        Unit - A unit enters ShipBIronspinePost <gen>
    Conditions
        (Triggering unit) Equal to TravelShipB
    Actions
        Trigger - Turn off (This trigger)
        Sound - Play TravelShipArrives <gen> at 100.00% volume, attached to TravelShipB
        Wait Campaign quest delay seconds
        -------- Allow Dialog For Shipmaster(X) --------
        Set VariableSet TravelShipB_Location = 3
        Set VariableSet TravelShipB_AtDeck = True
        -------- IF PLAYER TRAVELS - MOVE UNITS TO DECK --------
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                TravelShipB_Traveling Equal to True
                TravelShipB_Selection Equal to 3
            Then - Actions
                -------- ======== CINEMATIC ENDS ======== --------
                Trigger - Run Cinematic OFF <gen> (checking conditions)
                -------- ================== --------
                Set VariableSet TravelShipB_Traveling = False
                Set VariableSet TravelShipB_Point = (Center of TravelShipIronspineDeck <gen>)
                Camera - Reset camera for Player 1 (Red) to standard game-view over 0.00 seconds
                Cinematic - Turn cinematic mode Off for Player Group - Player 1 (Red)
                Unit Group - Pick every unit in TravelShip_Group and do (Actions)
                    Loop - Actions
                        Unit - Unhide (Picked unit)
                        Unit - Move (Picked unit) instantly to TravelShipB_Point, facing (Random angle) degrees
                Custom script:   call RUA_DestroyUnitAttachmentBJ(udg_Nazgrek)
                -------- handle leaks --------
                Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_TravelShipB_Point)
                Custom script:   call DestroyGroup(udg_TravelShip_Group)
                -------- Remove unit attach --------
                Custom script:   call RUA_DestroyUnitAttachmentBJ(udg_TravelShipB)
            Else - Actions
        Trigger - Turn on (This trigger)
